      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>B\u1EA2NG PH\xCDM \u0110I\u1EC0U KHI\u1EC2N:</b>\n\u2022 <b>[W / A / S / D]</b>: Di chuy\u1EC3n nh\xE2n v\u1EADt\n\u2022 <b>[Shift (Gi\u1EEF)]</b>: Ch\u1EA1y n\u01B0\u1EDBc r\xFAt (Sprint)\n\u2022 <b>[F]</b>: B\u1EADt / T\u1EAFt \u0110\xE8n pin (Flashlight)\n\u2022 <b>[E]</b>: T\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB / B\u1EA3ng \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n / M\u1EDF c\u1EEDa\n\u2022 <b>[ESC] ho\u1EB7c [E]</b>: \u0110\xF3ng giao di\u1EC7n ch\u1EC9 huy n\xE0y\n\n<b>QUY T\u1EAEC S\u1ED0NG C\xD2N TRONG B\xD3NG T\u1ED0I:</b>\n\u2022 <color=#F87171><b>TH\u1EF0C TH\u1EC2 B\xD3NG T\u1ED0I (THE SHADE):</b></color> Sinh v\u1EADt l\u1EA1 s\u0103n m\u1ED3i trong b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i. Tr\xE1nh ti\u1EBFp c\u1EADn tr\u1EF1c di\u1EC7n!\n\u2022 <b>\xC1NH S\xC1NG L\xC0 V\u0168 KH\xCD:</b> Th\u1EF1c th\u1EC3 b\u1ECB c\u1EA3n tr\u1EDF b\u1EDFi \xE1nh s\xE1ng m\u1EA1nh. Lu\xF4n ki\u1EC3m tra pin \u0111\xE8n pin tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi ti\u1EBFn v\xE0o h\xE0nh lang t\u1ED1i.\n\u2022 <b>S\u01A0 \u0110\u1ED2 TR\u1EA0M V\u0168 TR\u1EE4:</b>\n  <color=#67E8F9>Cabin 01 (Hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i) \u2192 Corridor \u2192 MedBay \u2192 Substation \u2192 Reactor Core \u2192 Airlock (Tho\xE1t hi\u1EC3m)</color>"
