--- !u!114 &1652552088
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1652552086}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#22C55E><b>M\u1EE4C TI\xCAU S\u1ED0NG C\xD2N: S\u01A0 T\xC1N KH\u1ECEI TR\u1EA0M QUA KHOANG AIRLOCK</b></color>\n\n<b>1. KH\xD4I PH\u1EE4C \u0110I\u1EC6N PH\u1EE4 (SUBSTATION):</b>\n\u2022 L\u01B0\u1EDBi \u0111i\u1EC7n ch\xEDnh t\xEA li\u1EC7t. Di chuy\u1EC3n t\u1EDBi tr\u1EA1m bi\u1EBFn \xE1p Substation.\n\u2022 K\xEDch ho\u1EA1t r\u01A1-le \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EDF c\xE1c c\u1EEDa an ninh ng\u0103n c\xE1ch ph\xE2n khu.\n\n<b>2. KH\u1EDEI \u0110\u1ED8NG L\xD2 PH\u1EA2N \u1EE8NG (REACTOR CORE):</b>\n\u2022 Di chuy\u1EC3n v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa \u0110\xF4ng, ti\u1EBFn v\xE0o bu\u1ED3ng ph\u1EA3n \u1EE9ng h\u1EA1t nh\xE2n.\n\u2022 T\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c b\u1EA3ng \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n ch\xEDnh \u0111\u1EC3 x\u1EA3 n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng kh\u1EA9n c\u1EA5p.\n\u2022 <color=#EF4444><b>C\u1EA2NH B\xC1O:</b> H\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1EBFm ng\u01B0\u1EE3c Meltdown (60s) s\u1EBD b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u!</color>\n\n<b>3. THU H\u1ED2I TH\u1EBA GHI \u0110\xC8 AN NINH (MEDBAY):</b>\n\u2022 C\u1EEDa tho\xE1t hi\u1EC3m Airlock b\u1ECB phong t\u1ECFa t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng.\n\u2022 T\xECm Th\u1EBB An Ninh (Security Keycard) t\u1EA1i MedBay \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EDF ch\u1ED1t.\n\n<b>4. S\u01A0 T\xC1N KH\u1EA8N C\u1EA4P (AIRLOCK EVACUATION) -> CHI\u1EBEN TH\u1EAENG:</b>\n\u2022 Ch\u1EA1y th\xE1o th\xE2n quay l\u1EA1i khoang Airlock tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi \u0111\u1EBFm ng\u01B0\u1EE3c v\u1EC1 0!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
